    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτᾰγωγ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>magical process of drawing down
				supernatural illumination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.955
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				301.22
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτᾰγωγ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i>enlightening, illuminating,</i>
			of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Mich.
				<u>in EN</u>
				554.29
			</span></i>; <i>bringing to light,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθεμίστων πραγμάτων</span>”
